{"title":"2014 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23fff01e85f7899d9a54f1a0b3042dac7517bc48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{16} + \\sqrt{9}}{\\sqrt{16 + 9}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"86\" height=\"48\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092a3c1ecb63ae83186544045aba681a8923ee8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{16} + \\sqrt{9}}{\\sqrt{16 + 9}} = \\frac{4 + 3}{\\sqrt{25}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"154\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/5/ec5e18e08ce2edbadf0d66d2df32f340ae4bf56e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\frac{7}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"45\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017234301\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 21/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 646/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.718      1 2014_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    7.718      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36020:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017234301 and revision id 279858. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}